911..983 Comment "/// The operator\'s turn: at its own world, holding one capability to the"
984..1056 Comment "/// seat\'s, it runs the seat\'s work there and takes the report back. The"
1057..1133 Comment "/// migration spends the capability, and the report crosses because its type"
1134..1155 Comment "/// is marked mobile."
